<<<
who it can have been it means God

only knows, & I do not; in Goodness

knows it wasn’t I it means God

knows & could confirm my state-

ment. Ambiguity is unlikely, but

not impossible.
===
+ *who it can have been* it means God only knows, & I do not; in *Goodness knows it wasn't I* it means God knows & could confirm my statement. Ambiguity is unlikely, but not impossible.
>>>

